  "description": "The Gaspard 20 is a true milestone in a young rider’s journey—a premium 20-inch kids’ bike built to deliver real performance and independence. With its mountain bike–inspired geometry, it offers confident handling, stability, and comfort, making it the perfect platform for children ready to take on longer rides and more varied terrain.\nAt the core of the Gaspard 20 is a 6061 T6 aluminium frameset, engineered for strength, lightness, and durability. Paired with high-quality Vee Tire Crown Gem tires, the bike delivers reliable traction and control whether on pavement, gravel, or trails. This setup ensures every ride feels smooth, safe, and fun.\nTo match growing skills, the Gaspard 20 features a Shimano Rapid Fire 7-speed transmission, giving kids the ability to tackle hills, pick up speed, and adapt easily to different conditions. The intuitive shifting system builds confidence and introduces them to real gear management in a way that feels natural and easy.\nEvery detail of the Gaspard 20 has been chosen to inspire progression, from its lightweight construction to its trail-ready components. More than just a kids’ bike, the Gaspard 20 is a stepping stone to adventure, independence, and the lifelong joy of cycling.",
